 * An impersonation grant is also the weaker credential by design (2h, no
 * `sessionVersion`), so it must not be promotable into the stronger one: it
 * carries no `sv`, which `realUser` reads as 0, and 0 is the DEFAULT
 * sessionVersion — so for any account that has never changed its password the
